# Cloudflare Pages Configuration Headers

# 1. Protect default staging domains from duplicate content issues
https://*.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

# 2. Allow full access and indexing on your live production domain
https://realsalarycheck.com/*
  X-Robots-Tag: index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

https://www.realsalarycheck.com/*
  X-Robots-Tag: index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin